  "referenceNumber": "RUS2754",
  "remarks": "\nINTERSHIPPING SERVICES LLC is an involved person under the Russia (EU Exit) (Sanctions) Regulations 2019 on the basis of the following ground: \n \nINTERSHIPPING SERVICES LLC is or has been involved in obtaining a benefit or supporting the Government of Russia by carrying on business in a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia, namely the Russian energy sector. \n",
